+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
+/*
+ * mmio_sign_ext - Test sign-extending MMIO load emulation (LDRSB/LDRSH/LDRSW)
+ *
+ * Copyright (c) 2026 Google LLC
+ * Author: Fuad Tabba <fuad.tabba@linux.dev>
